OL,3,ATwo sailors missing after tanker
OL,4,Aattacked in Strait of Hormuz, Oman says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo sailors are missing and 23 others
OL,7,Fhave been rescued following an attack
OL,8,Fon an oil tanker in the Strait of
OL,9,FHormuz, Oman says.
OL,11,FOman's Maritime Security Centre said
OL,12,Fthe Panama-flagged El Gaia was being
OL,13,Ftowed to an Omani port on Tuesday after
OL,14,Fa fire broke out in its engine room,
OL,15,Fadding that the vessel was targeted 1.3
OL,16,Fnautical miles (2.4km) north of the
OL,17,FMusandam peninsula.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
