OL,3,ATwo sailors missing after tanker
OL,4,Aattacked in Strait of Hormuz, Oman says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Iran's Revolutionary Guards
OL,7,Fsaid the tanker hit naval mines and
OL,8,Fcaught fire while passing through what
OL,9,Fthey described as a restricted and
OL,10,Funsafe route.
OL,12,FBut the US military insisted the
OL,13,FIranian report was false. It said the
OL,14,Ftanker was struck by an Iranian missile
OL,15,Flast month and again by a drone over
OL,16,Fthe weekend.
